Spec: Follow flip

Purpose:
  The manual direction flip. Part of the follow tracker.

Owns:
  ./follow_flip.dart

References:
  ./follow_tracker.sdd
  /docs/specs/history/18-follow-reverse.md

Must:
  While undecided, a flip forces reverse from the join.
  Once decided, a flip is a correction when the travel since the join runs forward in the new orientation,
    otherwise a U-turn; a U-turn on a loop starts a fresh lap and keeps the ridden range.
